  "description": "Make the forest your playground. Our NDURO 6 is a manoeuvrable Enduro eMTB with which you can master technical uphills just as easily as demanding downhills. Thanks to the geometry, you always have your bike under control, even in rough terrain. The mullet setup with 29″ front wheel and 27.5″ rear ensures optimum traction and better rollover behaviour in any terrain. And with the powerful Yamaha PW-X3 motor with a 720Wh battery and an optional range extender, you can even climb for longer at record speed. Powerful: thanks to the anti-squat properties of the progressive frame design, you will also easily master steep climbs before tackling the next rapid descent. Perfect conditions for shredding in the forest.",
